{"id": "unknown-2026-06-01-012", "date": "2026-06-01", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 6, "week": 23, "weekday": "Mon"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 1.0, "keywords": ["leading"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.65, "reasons": ["情緒極端"]}, "title": "Türkiye adds 1.97 GW of solar in January-April", "content": "<p>Türkiye’s Minister of Energy and Natural Resources, Alparslan Bayraktar, says solar is on track to overtake hydropower as the country’s leading source of electricity generation by the year end.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/01/turkiye-adds-1-97-gw-of-solar-in-january-april/\">Türkiye adds 1.97 GW of solar in January-April</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">pv magazine Global</a>.</p>\n", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/01/turkiye-adds-1-97-gw-of-solar-in-january-april/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "trina-2026-06-01-013", "date": "2026-06-01", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 6, "week": 23, "weekday": "Mon"}, "entities": {"companies": ["trina"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.5, "keywords": ["mass production"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Trina Solar announces 907 W tandem solar module with 29.2% efficiency", "content": "<p>The module achieved a full-panel conversion efficiency of 29.2% in testing by Germany’s TÜV SÜD and is designed for mass production rather than laboratory-scale use.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/01/trina-solar-announces-907-w-tandem-solar-module-with-29-2-efficiency/\">Trina Solar announces 907 W tandem solar module with 29.2% efficiency</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">pv magazine Global</a>.</p>\n", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/01/trina-solar-announces-907-w-tandem-solar-module-with-29-2-efficiency/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-06-01-014", "date": "2026-06-01", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 6, "week": 23, "weekday": "Mon"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Hoymiles launches new hybrid residential battery series", "content": "<p>Hoymiles has launched the HiBattery 4020 hybrid series for residential storage, including the PV-coupled 4020 X and AC-coupled 4020 AC designed for retrofit solar systems. Both models are modular and use LiFePO₄ cells with advanced safety features. </p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/01/hoymiles-launches-new-hybrid-residential-battery-series/\">Hoymiles launches new hybrid residential battery series</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">pv magazi", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/01/hoymiles-launches-new-hybrid-residential-battery-series/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "jinko-2026-06-01-015", "date": "2026-06-01", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 6, "week": 23, "weekday": "Mon"}, "entities": {"companies": ["jinko"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 1.0, "keywords": ["surpass"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.65, "reasons": ["情緒極端"]}, "title": "JinkoSolar shipped 86.8 GW of modules in 2025, securing lead in global sales for the seventh time", "content": "<p>The manufacturer recently released its 2025 annual report and Q1 2026 report. By the end of Q1 2026, JinkoSolar’s cumulative global module shipments had surpassed 400 GW. The company expects high-power modules above 640 W to account for more than 60% of its total module shipments in 2026.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/01/jinkosolar-shipped-86-8-gw-of-modules-in-2025-securing-lead-in-global-sales-for-the-seventh-time/\">JinkoSolar shipped 86.8 GW of modules in 202", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/01/jinkosolar-shipped-86-8-gw-of-modules-in-2025-securing-lead-in-global-sales-for-the-seventh-time/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-06-01-016", "date": "2026-06-01", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 6, "week": 23, "weekday": "Mon"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Lesotho seeks consultants for floating PV feasibility study", "content": "<p>A tender is open in Lesotho covering a feasibility study on the development of floating PV on two of the country's largest artificial lakes. The deadline for applications is June 29.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/01/lesotho-seeks-consultants-for-floating-pv-feasibility-study/\">Lesotho seeks consultants for floating PV feasibility study</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.pv-magazine.com\">pv magazine Global</a>.</p>\n", "sources": [{"name": "pv_magazine", "url": "https://www.pv-magazine.com/2026/06/01/lesotho-seeks-consultants-for-floating-pv-feasibility-study/", "type": "rss"}]}
